Subject: [PATCH] fix: load addon fonts and let the fallback font be pinned

FontString:SetFont with a font file an addon ships (Interface\AddOns\...)
fell back to the default font, as only Blizzard's font paths were known.
Load such files from the AddOns directories on first use, with the
weight, style and stretch of their face.

Without a WoW install Blizzard's fonts are missing and every WoW font
falls back to the first system face, which differs between operating
systems. WOW_SIM_FALLBACK_FONT names one font file to use instead, so
text measures and renders the same on macOS and Linux.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
